  "instructions": [
    "preheat oven to 375  f (190 c)",
    "whisk eggs in a large bowl and set aside",
    "cook shio-koji-cured bacon in a large skillet over medium heat, until crispy",
    "add diced tomatoes, scotch bonnet peppers, and low-sodium chicken broth to the skillet",
    "bring mixture to a simmer and cook for 5 minutes",
    "stir in shredded cheese and salt-free seasoning blend",
    "add cooked bacon to the egg mixture and stir to combine",
    "pour egg mixture over the skillet contents and cook until the eggs are almost set",
    "transfer the skillet to the preheated oven and bake for 12 - 15 minutes, or until the eggs are fully set",
    "remove the skillet from the oven and sprinkle chopped cilantro over the top",
    "serve warm, garnished with additional cilantro if desired"
